   [
    14.219,
    "And eighteen divided by six is also three."
   ],
   [
    17.917,
    "So one lap takes three minutes."
   ],
   [
    20.378,
    "That's the unit rate, and it goes in the first row."
   ],
   [
    23.542,
    "With the unit rate, any row is easy: ten laps take ten times three, which is thirty minutes."
   ]
  ]
